CHANGES
=======

Unreleased (2026-04-24)
-----------------------

Version 0.99.6 (2026-04-26)
---------------------------
* Allow `agent-run` to find the target command after wrapper arguments, so invocations like `agent-run --sandboxed --network codex` work the same as `agent-run codex --sandboxed --network`.

Version 0.99.5 (2026-04-25)
---------------------------
* Bootstrap missing default global templates, manifests, local templates, and overrides before `agent-run codex`, `agent-run claude`, or `agent-run update` render a profile.
* Avoid rewriting the config-root `.gitignore` when it already contains the generated-file ignore entries.

Version 0.99.4 (2026-04-24)
---------------------------
* Refactor profile generation around `agent-run.jsonc` manifests, Nunjucks templates, generated Codex and Claude homes, and private per-profile runtime output.
* Add generated native skill files, Codex `config.toml`, Claude `settings.json`, guard command shims, and a config-root `.gitignore` for generated outputs.
* Add Codex runtime modes with `--danger`, `--sandboxed`, and `--network`, defaulting to a private `CODEX_HOME` plus explicit `-C` project root handling.
* Change the default config root to `~/.agent-config`, add `AGENT_CONFIG_DIR`, and preserve existing config-root overrides.
* Add `agent-run migrate-config` for converting legacy `AGENTS-MODS.md` config trees into the new manifest/template layout.
* Add `jsonc-parser` and `nunjucks` runtime dependencies for JSONC manifests and template rendering.
* Add `-h` and `--help` output for `agent-run` and its built-in commands, while keeping `agent-run codex --help` and `agent-run claude --help` as passthrough to the underlying tools.
* Make `agent-run check` compare `AGENTS.md` against the same expanded template output that `agent-run update` writes, so placeholder-based profiles no longer fail as stale immediately after update.

Version 0.99.3 (2026-04-08)
---------------------------
* Replace the GitHub release action with `gh` so the workflow avoids the remaining Node 20 action warning.

Version 0.99.2 (2026-04-08)
---------------------------
* Update the release workflow to use current GitHub Actions versions that run on Node 24.
* Skip npm publish in the release workflow when the package version already exists on npm.

Version 0.99.1 (2026-04-08)
---------------------------
* Expand `{{AGENT_DIR}}`, `{{AGENTS_PATH}}`, and related placeholders from `AGENTS-MODS.md` when generating `AGENTS.md`.
* Make `pnpm release` create and push the release tag so GitHub Actions owns npm publishing.

Version 0.99.0 (2026-03-19)
---------------------------
* Normalize package metadata and license copyright text to `Technomoron.com`.

Version 0.99.0 (2026-03-19)
---------------------------
* Replace the shell wrapper with the Node and TypeScript-based `agent-run` utility.
* Add `check` and `init` commands, source-root support, and external agent-config mapping.
* Add `.agent-run-ignore` and `.agent-run.env` support for explicit ignore and profile overrides.
* Add a full README describing the tool, workflow, and mapping model.
* Add `edit` support for opening mapped `AGENTS-MODS.md`, including VS Code terminal handling and editor fallbacks.
* Move bundled project agent configs out of this repo into the external `agent-configs` tree.
